# Ezmerelda d'Avenir's Hunter's Ledger and her hub (docs/voice/ezmerelda.md; Story Allies Presence Plan, package M2).
# The hub, `allies/ezmerelda:talk`, is one conversation opened from wherever she stands (the tower shore, the abbey
# switchback, the Blue Water Inn's yard: one menu option each) and from clicking her while she travels with the party
# (her guest_talk in data/npcs/ezmerelda.json). Its lines read right in all of those places.
#   ledger  She names up to three of the thirteen killers below, from flags the regions already set: first the ones the
#           party has killed and she has not paid for (claim_*), then hunts in the region the party stands in, then the
#           hardest hunts the party's level reaches (brief_*, words only). Payment is her hunter's goods, scaled by level;
#           the fourth and eighth names also bring something from her wagon. Quest: hunters_ledger (docs/story/side_quests.md).
#   topics  Rudolph, her leg, the Vistani and what she thinks of where the party is going each play once (ezmerelda_heard_*),
#           and the hub offers at most the three first in the order of TOPICS below.
# Side flags are in data/flags/allies_ezmerelda.json; every flag read of the story's own is read-only here.
# Lines were drafted by Gemini through the ai-bridge (docs/plans/gemini_allies/M2/) and edited. All unvoiced.
# The picks (ledger_pick_*, hub_pick_*) are recomputed on every visit to the ledger or the menu and are not state.

~ talk
if not quest.hunters_ledger
quest hunters_ledger heard
endif
if not flag.ezmerelda_ledger_shown
-> ledger_intro
endif
if flag.ezmerelda_trust < 2
Ezmerelda: Hands where I can see them. What do you need?
else
Ezmerelda [smile]: Still breathing, all of you. What do you need, before my luck rubs off on you?
endif
-> menu

~ ledger_intro
set ezmerelda_ledger_shown
Narrator: She unwraps a battered book from its oilcloth. The pages are crowded with names, and the best ones are struck through in black ink.
Ezmerelda: Every killer in this valley I trust enough to ink, with a price beside each. I pay for proof, not promises.
Ezmerelda [sly]: I pay in what a hunter has: silver, holy water, remedies. Rudolph taught me to count the teeth before I count the coin.
Ezmerelda: Three names at a time, though. Four is a chore list, and I've had a lifetime of Rudolph's.
-> menu

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The menu

~ menu
set hub_slots = 0
set hub_pick_view_c = false
set hub_pick_view_b = false
set hub_pick_view_a = false
set hub_pick_rudolph = false
set hub_pick_leg = false
set hub_pick_vistani = false
if level >= 10 and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_view_c and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_view_c
set hub_slots += 1
endif
if level == 9 and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_view_b and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_view_b
set hub_slots += 1
endif
if level >= 7 and level <= 8 and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_view_a and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_view_a
set hub_slots += 1
endif
if true and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_rudolph and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_rudolph
set hub_slots += 1
endif
if true and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_leg and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_leg
set hub_slots += 1
endif
if true and not flag.ezmerelda_heard_vistani and flag.hub_slots < 3
set hub_pick_vistani
set hub_slots += 1
endif
* [if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid < 13] Let us see what work is in the ledger. -> ledger
* [if flag.hub_pick_view_c] What do you make of where we are heading? -> view_c
* [if flag.hub_pick_view_b] What do you make of where we are heading? -> view_b
* [if flag.hub_pick_view_a] What do you make of where we are heading? -> view_a
* [if flag.hub_pick_rudolph] How are things between you and Rudolph? -> rudolph
* [if flag.hub_pick_leg] Tell us what happened to your leg. -> leg
* [if flag.hub_pick_vistani] What do you make of the Vistani in this valley? -> vistani
* [if not guest:ezmerelda and tarokka.ally.npc == ezmerelda] Hunt with us. -> abbey_of_st_markovia/ezmerelda:join
* [if not guest:ezmerelda and tarokka.ally.npc != ezmerelda and flag.ezmerelda_trust >= 2] Hunt with us. -> allies/ezmerelda_hunt:join
* We should get moving. -> bye

~ bye
Ezmerelda: Silver first, questions never, and don't die between here and the next crossroads.
-> END

~ rudolph
set ezmerelda_heard_rudolph
if flag.van_richten_reunited
Ezmerelda [weary]: My knuckles still ache from hitting his arm, and he's already correcting how I oil my crossbow.
Ezmerelda [smile]: We're speaking, mostly in arguments. That's how Rudolph says he missed me.
elif flag.ezmerelda_left_tower and not flag.ezmerelda_back_at_camp and not flag.rictavio_gone
Ezmerelda: Twelve years of following him, and all that's left is a painted wagon and an inn door.
Ezmerelda [weary]: It's easier to track a werewolf in the dark than to find out whether your teacher wanted to be found.
else
Ezmerelda [angry]: Twelve years I've followed him, right up to a door he keyed to my name alone, and still no Rudolph.
Ezmerelda: Don't worry about him. I'm very good at looking, and when I find him he'll wish a monster had got there first.
endif
-> menu

~ leg
set ezmerelda_heard_leg
if flag.kiril_defeated or flag.den_broken
Ezmerelda: The hills above Lake Zarovich, back when I was young and quick and stupid. Kiril took it laughing, with his black jaws wide.
Ezmerelda [weary]: Rudolph built this brace, and it kicks harder than the old one. With the wolf dead, I mostly just feel lighter.
else
Ezmerelda: A big black wolf named Kiril, in the hills above Lake Zarovich, while I was busy being young and quick and stupid.
Ezmerelda [sly]: Rudolph built the brace. The lesson I built myself: never swing at a mouth that's still laughing at you.
endif
-> menu

~ vistani
set ezmerelda_heard_vistani
Ezmerelda: They're my people when the wagons will have me. Guiding travellers through a valley that eats them is a tightrope, and they walk it.
Ezmerelda [weary]: Between Madam Eva at Tser Pool dealing me into other people's games and the camp outside Vallaki, I keep my distance.
Ezmerelda: Pay what they ask, leave their horses alone, and never mistake a warm fire for a free favour.
-> menu

~ view_a
set ezmerelda_heard_view_a
Ezmerelda: Wolves on the hill roads, a witch in the drowned village, dead knights in their manor. Pick your fights before you draw steel.
Ezmerelda: And watch the abbey hardest. Whatever's playing at holiness up there has a butcher's hand with a needle.
-> menu

~ view_b
set ezmerelda_heard_view_b
Ezmerelda: Tsolenka Pass is a cliff road. A roc hunts the gorge by day, and a ghostly watch keeps the gate shut.
Ezmerelda [sly]: Beyond it is the Amber Temple, where old powers sell gifts for a price. Take one, and I'll be counting my silver twice.
-> menu

~ view_c
set ezmerelda_heard_view_c
Ezmerelda: I don't plan the castle until I'm looking at its gates. Paper plans die on the drawbridge.
Ezmerelda: But remember Rudolph's first rule for the count's house: know which window you're jumping out of before you open the door.
-> menu

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The ledger

# Up to three names: the party's kills she hasn't paid for first (oldest name first), then the hunts in the region the
# party is standing in, then the hardest hunts its level reaches. Each pass skips what an earlier pass picked.
~ ledger
set ledger_named = 0
set ledger_ready = 0
set ledger_pick_falls = false
set ledger_pick_wagon = false
set ledger_pick_fowlers = false
set ledger_pick_vine = false
set ledger_pick_morgantha = false
set ledger_pick_wint = false
set ledger_pick_huntsman = false
set ledger_pick_grandsire = false
set ledger_pick_kiril = false
set ledger_pick_khazan = false
set ledger_pick_lysaga = false
set ledger_pick_sarkhaza = false
set ledger_pick_eye = false
# 1. killed and not yet paid
if flag.falls_werewolf_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_falls and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_falls
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.wagon_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_wagon and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wagon
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.fowlers_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_fowlers and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_fowlers
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.vine_mother_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_vine and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_vine
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.morgantha_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_morgantha and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_morgantha
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.yester_hill_resolved and not flag.ledger_paid_wint and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wint
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.huntsman_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_huntsman and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_huntsman
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.grandsire_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_grandsire and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_grandsire
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if (flag.kiril_defeated or flag.den_broken) and not flag.ledger_paid_kiril and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_kiril
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.khazan_destroyed and not flag.ledger_paid_khazan and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_khazan
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.lysaga_dead and not flag.ledger_paid_lysaga and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_lysaga
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.sarkhaza_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_sarkhaza and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_sarkhaza
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
if flag.eye_below_slain and not flag.ledger_paid_eye and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_eye
set ledger_named += 1
set ledger_ready += 1
endif
# 2. open hunts where the party stands (that its level reaches)
if region:svalich_road and level >= 3 and not flag.falls_werewolf_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_falls and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_falls
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:svalich_road and level >= 4 and not flag.wagon_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_wagon and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wagon
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:lake_zarovich and level >= 5 and not flag.fowlers_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_fowlers and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_fowlers
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:wizard_of_wines and level >= 5 and not flag.vine_mother_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_vine and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_vine
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:old_bonegrinder and level >= 5 and not flag.morgantha_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_morgantha and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bargain" or flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bella")
set ledger_pick_morgantha
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:yester_hill and level >= 6 and not flag.yester_hill_resolved and not flag.ledger_pick_wint and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wint
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:svalich_road and level >= 7 and not flag.huntsman_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_huntsman and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_huntsman
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:krezk and level >= 7 and not flag.grandsire_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_grandsire and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (quest.the_packs_runt == given)
set ledger_pick_grandsire
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:werewolf_den and level >= 7 and not flag.kiril_defeated and not flag.den_broken and not flag.ledger_pick_kiril and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.wolf_pack_leader == "kiril")
set ledger_pick_kiril
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:van_richtens_tower and level >= 7 and not flag.khazan_destroyed and not flag.ledger_pick_khazan and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_khazan
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:berez and level >= 8 and not flag.lysaga_dead and not flag.ledger_pick_lysaga and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.lysaga_fate == "bargained" or flag.lysaga_fate == "broken")
set ledger_pick_lysaga
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:mount_ghakis and level >= 9 and not flag.sarkhaza_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_sarkhaza and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_sarkhaza
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if region:amber_temple and level >= 9 and not flag.eye_below_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_eye and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_eye
set ledger_named += 1
endif
# 3. the hardest open hunts the party's level reaches
if level >= 9 and not flag.eye_below_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_eye and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_eye
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 9 and not flag.sarkhaza_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_sarkhaza and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_sarkhaza
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 8 and not flag.lysaga_dead and not flag.ledger_pick_lysaga and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.lysaga_fate == "bargained" or flag.lysaga_fate == "broken")
set ledger_pick_lysaga
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 7 and not flag.khazan_destroyed and not flag.ledger_pick_khazan and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_khazan
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 7 and not flag.kiril_defeated and not flag.den_broken and not flag.ledger_pick_kiril and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.wolf_pack_leader == "kiril")
set ledger_pick_kiril
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 7 and not flag.grandsire_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_grandsire and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (quest.the_packs_runt == given)
set ledger_pick_grandsire
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 7 and not flag.huntsman_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_huntsman and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_huntsman
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 6 and not flag.yester_hill_resolved and not flag.ledger_pick_wint and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wint
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 5 and not flag.morgantha_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_morgantha and flag.ledger_named < 3 and not (flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bargain" or flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bella")
set ledger_pick_morgantha
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 5 and not flag.vine_mother_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_vine and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_vine
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 5 and not flag.fowlers_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_fowlers and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_fowlers
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 4 and not flag.wagon_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_wagon and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_wagon
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if level >= 3 and not flag.falls_werewolf_slain and not flag.ledger_pick_falls and flag.ledger_named < 3
set ledger_pick_falls
set ledger_named += 1
endif
if flag.ledger_named == 0
-> ledger_none
endif
if flag.ledger_ready > 0
Ezmerelda [sly]: You smell like smoke and fresh work. Point to the name you finished and let's settle up.
else
Ezmerelda: Nothing's owed yet, so these are the hunts I'd take in your boots. Pick a name.
endif
-> ledger_menu

# Nothing to put in front of the party. At level 9 every name the book can still offer is struck or spared, so a party that
# spared some names (below) is offered the book's close (sq-stuck, finding 134): it ends as a failure, not struck through.
# The sparing is the ledger's own rule for dropping a name from its hunts (see the picks above); if the party later kills
# one of them anyway the claim pays as always, and thirteen paid still ends the quest as ledger_struck.
~ ledger_none
set ledger_spared = 0
set ledger_spared_kiril = false
set ledger_spared_grandsire = false
set ledger_spared_morgantha = false
set ledger_spared_lysaga = false
if flag.wolf_pack_leader == "kiril" and not flag.kiril_defeated and not flag.den_broken
set ledger_spared_kiril
set ledger_spared += 1
endif
if quest.the_packs_runt == given and not flag.grandsire_slain
set ledger_spared_grandsire
set ledger_spared += 1
endif
if (flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bargain" or flag.bonegrinder_fate == "bella") and not flag.morgantha_slain
set ledger_spared_morgantha
set ledger_spared += 1
endif
if (flag.lysaga_fate == "bargained" or flag.lysaga_fate == "broken") and not flag.lysaga_dead
set ledger_spared_lysaga
set ledger_spared += 1
endif
if level >= 9 and flag.ledger_spared > 0 and quest.hunters_ledger != ledger_closed
-> ledger_spared_close
endif
Ezmerelda [weary]: Nothing in reach that's worth your boots, and the rest would eat you whole. Come back once the valley's moved.
-> menu

~ ledger_spared_close
Ezmerelda [weary]: Every name in reach is struck, and what's left on the page is breathing by your leave.
if flag.ledger_spared_kiril
Ezmerelda: Kiril Stoyanovich stays in ink: you left him running the den, and I pay for pelts, not politics.
endif
if flag.ledger_spared_grandsire
Ezmerelda: The Grandsire in Krezk stays open too, since you brought him little Petru instead of a silver bolt.
endif
if flag.ledger_spared_morgantha
Ezmerelda: Morgantha's line stays unmarked while your terms around Old Bonegrinder hold and the old hag draws breath.
endif
if flag.ledger_spared_lysaga
Ezmerelda: Baba Lysaga stays on the page: broken or bargained with in Berez, she isn't dead enough for my ink.
endif
Ezmerelda: I won't ink a bargain as a kill, so we close the ledger as it stands or leave it open.
* Close the book at what we've struck. -> ledger_close
* Leave the ledger open for now. -> menu

~ ledger_close
quest hunters_ledger ledger_closed
Ezmerelda [weary]: A hunter isn't a judge, though Rudolph would grumble for a week at an untidy page.
Ezmerelda: The buckle goes shut on the work you did, and the ink stays dry on the rest.
Ezmerelda [sly]: If any of your old bargains sours and needs silver after all, bring me the proof and I'll pay.
-> menu

~ ledger_menu
* [if flag.ledger_pick_falls and not flag.falls_werewolf_slain] Tell us about Dragan at Tser Falls. -> brief_falls
* [if flag.ledger_pick_falls and flag.falls_werewolf_slain] Dragan is dead at Tser Falls. -> claim_falls
* [if flag.ledger_pick_wagon and not flag.wagon_slain] Tell us about the tinker's wagon at the crossroads. -> brief_wagon
* [if flag.ledger_pick_wagon and flag.wagon_slain] We killed the tinker's wagon and freed Iosif. -> claim_wagon
* [if flag.ledger_pick_fowlers and not flag.fowlers_slain] Tell us about the count's fowlers on the hill trail. -> brief_fowlers
* [if flag.ledger_pick_fowlers and flag.fowlers_slain] The count's fowlers above Lake Zarovich are dead. -> claim_fowlers
* [if flag.ledger_pick_vine and not flag.vine_mother_slain] Tell us about the Vine Mother in the vineyard. -> brief_vine
* [if flag.ledger_pick_vine and flag.vine_mother_slain] We cut down the Vine Mother in the Seventh Row. -> claim_vine
* [if flag.ledger_pick_morgantha and not flag.morgantha_slain] Tell us about Morgantha at Old Bonegrinder. -> brief_morgantha
* [if flag.ledger_pick_morgantha and flag.morgantha_slain] Morgantha is dead and the coven is broken. -> claim_morgantha
* [if flag.ledger_pick_wint and not flag.yester_hill_resolved] Tell us about Wintersplinter on Yester Hill. -> brief_wint
* [if flag.ledger_pick_wint and flag.yester_hill_resolved] We destroyed Wintersplinter on the crown of Yester Hill. -> claim_wint
* [if flag.ledger_pick_huntsman and not flag.huntsman_slain] Tell us about the Count's Huntsman. -> brief_huntsman
* [if flag.ledger_pick_huntsman and flag.huntsman_slain] We killed the Count's Huntsman and his hounds at the crossroads. -> claim_huntsman
* [if flag.ledger_pick_grandsire and not flag.grandsire_slain] Tell us about the Grandsire. -> brief_grandsire
* [if flag.ledger_pick_grandsire and flag.grandsire_slain] We killed the Grandsire in Krezk's square. -> claim_grandsire
* [if flag.ledger_pick_kiril and not flag.kiril_defeated and not flag.den_broken] Tell us about Kiril Stoyanovich. -> brief_kiril
* [if flag.ledger_pick_kiril and (flag.kiril_defeated or flag.den_broken)] Kiril is dead in his den. -> claim_kiril
* [if flag.ledger_pick_khazan and not flag.khazan_destroyed] Tell us about Khazan under the tower. -> brief_khazan
* [if flag.ledger_pick_khazan and flag.khazan_destroyed] We destroyed Khazan under the tower. -> claim_khazan
* [if flag.ledger_pick_lysaga and not flag.lysaga_dead] Tell us about Baba Lysaga in Berez. -> brief_lysaga
* [if flag.ledger_pick_lysaga and flag.lysaga_dead] Baba Lysaga is dead in the marsh. -> claim_lysaga
* [if flag.ledger_pick_sarkhaza and not flag.sarkhaza_slain] Tell us about the dragon Sarkhaza. -> brief_sarkhaza
* [if flag.ledger_pick_sarkhaza and flag.sarkhaza_slain] We killed Sarkhaza under Mount Ghakis. -> claim_sarkhaza
* [if flag.ledger_pick_eye and not flag.eye_below_slain] Tell us about the Eye Below. -> brief_eye
* [if flag.ledger_pick_eye and flag.eye_below_slain] The Eye Below is dead in the vaults. -> claim_eye
* That's enough names for now. -> menu

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The names, one briefing and one payment each

# Dragan, the werewolf at Tser Falls (flag falls_werewolf_slain; fought in svalich_road; named from level 3).
~ brief_falls
Ezmerelda: Dragan, one of Kiril's pack. He waits at the lip of Tser Falls at night, with wolves and a dire wolf for company.
Ezmerelda: Put silver in him first, keep your back off that drop, and come tell me when the rock only holds tokens again.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_falls
set ledger_paid_falls
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [sly]: One less of Kiril's on the hills, and nothing left at the falls but scratches in the stone.
Ezmerelda: His name comes out of the book. Take the silver-headed bolts and a healing draught, and stitch yourselves up.
give crossbow_bolt 10
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the Tinker's Wagon (flag wagon_slain; fought in svalich_road; named from level 4).
~ brief_wagon
Ezmerelda: That green tinker's wagon at the crossroads is a mimic the size of a wagon, with old Iosif on the board as bait.
Ezmerelda: Don't touch its pots, and stay clear of the tailboard. Burn it from range, and let Iosif go home to Tser Pool.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_wagon
set ledger_paid_wagon
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [weary]: Seven years on that board, bait for his own wagon. I'm glad Iosif walked back to the Tser Pool camp.
Ezmerelda: The wagon's crossed off. Take the alchemist's fire and the silver-headed bolts, and a healing draught for the road.
give alchemists_fire 3
give crossbow_bolt 10
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the count's fowlers on the hill trail (flag fowlers_slain; fought in lake_zarovich; named from level 5).
~ brief_fowlers
Ezmerelda: On the hill trail above Lake Zarovich a silver cage hangs in a dead pine. It's bait.
Ezmerelda: The count's fowlers wait in the branches: vampire spawn and bats. Look up before you touch the cage, and tell me when it's quiet.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_fowlers
set ledger_paid_fowlers
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: A cage in a dead pine is a baited hook. Whoever hung it was fishing for you.
Ezmerelda [smile]: The fowlers are struck from the page. Take the holy water and the silver-headed bolts, and a healing draught.
give holy_water 3
give crossbow_bolt 10
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the Vine Mother (flag vine_mother_slain; fought in wizard_of_wines; named from level 5).
~ brief_vine
Ezmerelda: A cutting of the old Gulthias tree grew into that vineyard's Seventh Row, tall as two houses. It drags you in and spits black wine.
Ezmerelda: Clear the blights round it first, stay out of its reach, and tell me when the row stays down.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_vine
set ledger_paid_vine
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: Druids plant one black stick and the whole row tries to drink you. I can smell the sour wine from here.
Ezmerelda: The Vine Mother is crossed out. Take the scroll against plants, the alchemist's fire and a healing draught.
give scroll_of_protection_plant
give alchemists_fire 3
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Morgantha of Old Bonegrinder (flag morgantha_slain; fought in old_bonegrinder; named from level 5).
~ brief_morgantha
Ezmerelda: Morgantha and her two daughters keep Old Bonegrinder, the windmill between Barovia and Vallaki. They cage the children whose parents can't pay for dream pastries.
Ezmerelda [angry]: Don't take on all three hags at once. Hold a holy symbol up in the sun if you can, and break that coven.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_morgantha
set ledger_paid_morgantha
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: She talked sugar the whole time she was locking children in cages. A hag alone is a coward, and a dead coven stays quiet.
Ezmerelda: Morgantha's name is struck for good. Take the scroll against fiends, the holy water and the antitoxin.
give scroll_of_protection_fiend
give holy_water 2
give antitoxin 2
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Wintersplinter on Yester Hill (flag yester_hill_resolved; fought in yester_hill; named from level 6).
~ brief_wint
Ezmerelda: Up on Yester Hill, in the druids' stone circle, stands Wintersplinter: a walking tree blight with a green stone pulsing in its split heartwood.
Ezmerelda: Don't let the druids pin you against their stacked skulls. Aim for the split wood and bring it down.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_wint
set ledger_paid_wint
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: They dug the mountain folk out of their mounds to stack skulls for a walking tree. Even for this valley, that's ugly.
Ezmerelda: Wintersplinter is out of the ledger. Take the alchemist's fire and some bolts with a keener edge.
give alchemists_fire 3
give ammunition_plus_1__crossbow_bolt 6
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 1
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the Count's Huntsman (flag huntsman_slain; fought in svalich_road; named from level 7).
~ brief_huntsman
Ezmerelda: Toader, the count's Huntsman, hunts the Svalich woods on cold nights. A horn sounds; by morning someone lies run to death under the gallows.
Ezmerelda: Steady your nerve when the horn goes. Watch his boar spear and black arrows, and end the hunt at the gallows.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_huntsman
set ledger_paid_huntsman
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [sad]: Every quarry he ran down became one of his hounds. My people scratched their names on cairns by the road.
Ezmerelda: Toader's hunt is struck from the book. Take the scroll against the undead, the draught against grave-cold and the holy water.
give scroll_of_protection_undead
give potion_of_resistance_necrotic
give holy_water 3
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the Grandsire (flag grandsire_slain; fought in krezk; named from level 7).
~ brief_grandsire
Ezmerelda: The pack's eldest: white with age, one ear, big as a cart horse. At night he comes over Krezk's wall for the goat pens.
Ezmerelda: His howl empties your nerve and his bite puts you on your back. Thin the old wolves first, and bring me proof.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_grandsire
set ledger_paid_grandsire
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [sly]: He taught Kiril everything he knows and answered to nobody after. Sounds like another old teacher I could name.
Ezmerelda: The Grandsire is crossed out. Take these keener bolts and a healing draught; they're yours.
give ammunition_plus_1__crossbow_bolt 10
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Kiril Stoyanovich (flag kiril_defeated, or den_broken: the reckoning kills him with Emil's pack; fought in werewolf_den; named from level 7).
~ brief_kiril
Ezmerelda: Kiril Stoyanovich dens in the hills above Lake Zarovich and steals farm children from below Krezk to grow a pack for the castle.
Ezmerelda: He laughs with his mouth open and calls armed men meat with swords. Silver first, give him no room, and tell me when he's done.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_kiril
set ledger_paid_kiril
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: That name has been in this book longer than any other, and the ink was wearing through the page.
Ezmerelda: He's struck out for good. Take the keener bolts and a healing draught; they're yours.
give ammunition_plus_1__crossbow_bolt 10
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Khazan, under the tower (flag khazan_destroyed; fought in van_richtens_tower; named from level 7).
~ brief_khazan
Ezmerelda: Under Rudolph's tower on Lake Baratok sits Khazan, an archmage who made himself a lich with his own name cut over the door.
Ezmerelda: He's polite right up until his touch freezes you. Don't offer him your name, and tell me when the cellar is quiet.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_khazan
set ledger_paid_khazan
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [weary]: I camped on that shore for months, knowing the lock answered to his name and never guessing what the name had made of him.
Ezmerelda: One less courteous corpse under the tower. Take the scroll against the undead, the draught against grave-cold and the holy water.
give scroll_of_protection_undead
give potion_of_resistance_necrotic
give holy_water 4
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 2
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Baba Lysaga (flag lysaga_dead; fought in berez; named from level 8).
~ brief_lysaga
Ezmerelda: Baba Lysaga keeps house in drowned Berez, in a hut on a walking stump. Scarecrows guard it, and she keeps swarms in jars.
Ezmerelda: She casts like a wizard and fusses over her boy. Burn the straw men early, refuse supper, and tell me when she's quiet.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_lysaga
set ledger_paid_lysaga
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda: I've cut her scarecrows down on that marsh before, and there were always three more watching before my blade was dry.
Ezmerelda: The old witch is struck from the page. Take the alchemist's fire and the rest; it's yours.
give ammunition_plus_2__crossbow_bolt 6
give alchemists_fire 3
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 3
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# Sarkhaza (flag sarkhaza_slain; fought in mount_ghakis; named from level 9).
~ brief_sarkhaza
Ezmerelda: Sarkhaza, a red dragon, chained by the neck under Mount Ghakis with her wings riveted shut. She lies on a hoard of gilded lead.
Ezmerelda: She's starved on grave-salt, and the count's cart brings a cage every new moon. Mind the chain's reach, and bring me proof she's cold.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_sarkhaza
set ledger_paid_sarkhaza
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [sad]: Forty years in the dark on false gold, eating what came in cages. A ledger only asks who ate, not who held the leash.
Ezmerelda: Her name is struck. Take the fire draughts and the bolts with it; they're yours.
give potion_of_resistance_fire 2
give ammunition_plus_2__crossbow_bolt 8
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 3
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# the Eye Below (flag eye_below_slain; fought in amber_temple; named from level 9).
~ brief_eye
Ezmerelda: Sealed in amber under the Amber Temple's vaults lies the Eye Below, a floating orb with a mouth like a sack of knives.
Ezmerelda: The wardens could only sing it to sleep, and its ten small eyes will unmake you. Blind the stalks, and bring me proof it's still.
-> ledger_menu

~ claim_eye
set ledger_paid_eye
set ezmerelda_ledger_paid += 1
Ezmerelda [smile]: The wardens settled for a lullaby, and you lot went down there and finished the song.
Ezmerelda: The Eye Below is struck out. Take the scroll against aberrations and the rest; it's yours.
give scroll_of_protection_aberration
give ammunition_plus_2__crossbow_bolt 8
if level >= 9
give potion_of_healing_superior 2
elif level >= 7
give potion_of_healing_greater 3
else
give potion_of_healing 3
endif
-> claim_end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- After a payment

# One more name struck: the journal moves on, the first payment warms her a little, and the fourth and eighth names
# bring a gift from her wagon (a +1 light crossbow, uncommon; Mage Breaker, rare). The crossbow is the only one in the story;
# Dmitri Krezkov also sells a Mage Breaker from party level 5, so hers is not one of a kind.
~ claim_end
if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid == 1
set ezmerelda_trust += 1
quest hunters_ledger paying
endif
if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid == 7
quest hunters_ledger half_struck
endif
if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid >= 4 and not flag.ezmerelda_ledger_gift_a
-> milestone_a
endif
-> claim_end_b

~ milestone_a
set ezmerelda_ledger_gift_a
Ezmerelda: That's four names struck from the book, which means you're no longer lucky beginners.
Ezmerelda [smile]: Take this spare light crossbow from the wagon. I've stopped using it, and it shoots straighter than most people talk.
give weapon_plus_1__light_crossbow
-> claim_end_b

~ claim_end_b
if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid >= 8 and not flag.ezmerelda_ledger_gift_b
-> milestone_b
endif
-> claim_end_c

~ milestone_b
set ezmerelda_ledger_gift_b
Ezmerelda: Eight names down, and the pages are starting to look more like crossings-out than a list.
Ezmerelda [sly]: Take this dagger from my wagon. It's got a very good name for ruining a mage's afternoon.
give mage_breaker__dagger
-> claim_end_c

~ claim_end_c
if flag.ezmerelda_ledger_paid >= 13
-> done
endif
-> ledger

~ done
quest hunters_ledger ledger_struck
Ezmerelda [weary]: Thirteen names struck, and there isn't another killer in this valley I trust enough to ink onto the page.
Ezmerelda [smile]: The book is closed, and for once I'm not even in a hurry, though Rudolph will think I've caught a fever.
-> menu
